<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns the nth specified object with the appropriate tag
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>GetObjectByTag only gets objects that are currently loaded into memory, meaning any objects in the current area list (active or inactive), as well as objects like world maps and map locations (also anything in the char_stage area).
</p>
